OL,3,GNEWSAI'm carrying a boulder for a
OL,4,Ahundred days to symbolise men's
OL,5,Astruggles
OL,6,
OL,7,FA 25kg boulder might seem an unusual
OL,8,Fcompanion for a daily walk, but for
OL,9,FSteve Marshall it has become a powerful
OL,10,Fsymbol of the burdens men carry through
OL,11,Flife.
OL,13,FSteve, from Telford, is carrying the
OL,14,Frock on his shoulder for a hundred days
OL,15,Fto raise awareness of men's mental
OL,16,Fhealth and raise money for charity.
OL,18,FHe carried the boulder to the top of
OL,19,FThe Wrekin on Saturday as part of the
OL,20,Fchallenge, marking his 45th day of the
OL,21,Fchallenge.
